t":"Delete は Del なんですよ…w","ts":"1637312494.100600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DWL"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                                *\u0026lt;S-Del\u0026gt;*\nShift-Del       ビジュアルモードでテキストを切り取る(クリップボードに)\nCTRL-X          ビジュアルモードでテキストを切り取る(クリップボードに)\n \n以下のマッピングは同様の目的を果たす(VimのWin32とDJGPPバージョン):\n \nキー            キーコード   Normal     Visual      挿入モード  \nShift-Insert    \u0026lt;M-N\u0026gt;\u0026lt;M-T\u0026gt;   \"*P        \"-d\"*P      \u0026lt;C-R\u0026gt;\u0026lt;C-O\u0026gt;*\nCTRL-Insert     \u0026lt;M-N\u0026gt;\u0026lt;M-U\u0026gt;              \"*y\nShift-Del       \u0026lt;M-N\u0026gt;\u0026lt;M-W\u0026gt;              \"*d\nCTRL-Del        \u0026lt;M-N\u0026gt;\u0026lt;M-X\u0026gt;              \"*d\nCTRL-X          \u0026lt;C-X\u0026gt;                   \"*d\n \nもしくは次のマッピング(VimのWin32ではないバージョン):\n \nキー            キーコード   Normal     Visual      挿入モード  \nShift-Insert    \u0026lt;M-N\u0026gt;\u0026lt;M-T\u0026gt;   P          d\"0P        \u0026lt;C-R\u0026gt;\u0026lt;C-O\u0026gt;\"\nCTRL-Insert     \u0026lt;M-N\u0026gt;\u0026lt;M-U\u0026gt;              y\nShift-Del       \u0026lt;M-N\u0026gt;\u0026lt;M-W\u0026gt;              d\nCTRL-Del        \u0026lt;M-N\u0026gt;\u0026lt;M-X\u0026gt;              d\n \nクリップボードがサポートされているときは、レジスタの \"* が使える。\n```","ts":"1637312485.100300","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"b03a6fe3-6d8a-42b1-aea4-ab1baf6f5f07","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":":h \u0026lt;S-Del\u0026gt;","ts":"1637312484.100200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=h7R"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"E149: 残念ですが \u0026lt;S-Delete\u0026gt; にはヘルプがありません","ts":"1637312439.099700","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace